    "name": "Astra Sentinel",
    "steam_appid": 3171790,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/02562930c767a88134ec9c5ff6e08baf.avif?t=1751018853\" width=600 height=150 /></span><i>Astra Sentinel is a single-player RTS in which you will be able to test your skills as a strategist and defend humanity from extinction. When you start a game you will have to regain control of the infected planets in the solar system. Once you have colonized a planet, build on its surface by switching from a planetary to a space view without loading screens. Enjoy an epic campaign mode or prove your worth in the infinitely replayable skirmish mode.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/e8763e488598e9e65492e61f10fa498b.webp?t=1751018853\" width=600 height=20 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/6f5256e557215aabc07116f164f438a1.webp?t=1751018853\" width=615 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/87ab99c98a4f4d4fa1e6e70361ea4aba.poster.avif?t=1751018853\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/87ab99c98a4f4d4fa1e6e70361ea4aba.webm?t=1751018853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/87ab99c98a4f4d4fa1e6e70361ea4aba.mp4?t=1751018853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face an endless horde of aliens who seek only to infect all worlds in their path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create lines of defense between your planets, take advantage of the coverage of asteroid belts, place energy shields, deploy space turrets and fight against extinction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on the attack at the right time and reconquer planets to increase your production lines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/a71eff66edeeafa3a74c54f12701c130.webp?t=1751018853\" width=615 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/aeb986c86dccdcbc3829e363b768d2ed.poster.avif?t=1751018853\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/aeb986c86dccdcbc3829e363b768d2ed.webm?t=1751018853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/aeb986c86dccdcbc3829e363b768d2ed.mp4?t=1751018853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconquer worlds infected by an alien plague.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore solar systems and find different types of planets, from icy worlds to desert wastelands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build on the planetary surface and return to the space view without loading screens!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/bfe33c67d8fd6d84ba882f0617eb8bed.webp?t=1751018853\" width=615 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/fdceb194271cbdb8a161eba26347a0f4.poster.avif?t=1751018853\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/fdceb194271cbdb8a161eba26347a0f4.webm?t=1751018853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/fdceb194271cbdb8a161eba26347a0f4.mp4?t=1751018853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic campaign in which you will have to regain control of several solar systems around the galaxy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your worth in skirmish mode. Adjust the parameters to your liking and randomly generate a different solar system in each game for infinite replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face numerous difficulty levels that will test your strategist skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/e8763e488598e9e65492e61f10fa498b.webp?t=1751018853\" width=600 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/ffe3bb284defdeb2e616d986d4b2fae4.avif?t=1751018853\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/02562930c767a88134ec9c5ff6e08baf.avif?t=1751018853\" width=600 height=150 /></span><i>Astra Sentinel is a single-player RTS in which you will be able to test your skills as a strategist and defend humanity from extinction. When you start a game you will have to regain control of the infected planets in the solar system. Once you have colonized a planet, build on its surface by switching from a planetary to a space view without loading screens. Enjoy an epic campaign mode or prove your worth in the infinitely replayable skirmish mode.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/e8763e488598e9e65492e61f10fa498b.webp?t=1751018853\" width=600 height=20 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/6f5256e557215aabc07116f164f438a1.webp?t=1751018853\" width=615 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/87ab99c98a4f4d4fa1e6e70361ea4aba.poster.avif?t=1751018853\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/87ab99c98a4f4d4fa1e6e70361ea4aba.webm?t=1751018853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/87ab99c98a4f4d4fa1e6e70361ea4aba.mp4?t=1751018853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face an endless horde of aliens who seek only to infect all worlds in their path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create lines of defense between your planets, take advantage of the coverage of asteroid belts, place energy shields, deploy space turrets and fight against extinction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on the attack at the right time and reconquer planets to increase your production lines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/a71eff66edeeafa3a74c54f12701c130.webp?t=1751018853\" width=615 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/aeb986c86dccdcbc3829e363b768d2ed.poster.avif?t=1751018853\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/aeb986c86dccdcbc3829e363b768d2ed.webm?t=1751018853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/aeb986c86dccdcbc3829e363b768d2ed.mp4?t=1751018853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconquer worlds infected by an alien plague.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore solar systems and find different types of planets, from icy worlds to desert wastelands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build on the planetary surface and return to the space view without loading screens!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/bfe33c67d8fd6d84ba882f0617eb8bed.webp?t=1751018853\" width=615 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/fdceb194271cbdb8a161eba26347a0f4.poster.avif?t=1751018853\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/fdceb194271cbdb8a161eba26347a0f4.webm?t=1751018853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/fdceb194271cbdb8a161eba26347a0f4.mp4?t=1751018853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic campaign in which you will have to regain control of several solar systems around the galaxy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your worth in skirmish mode. Adjust the parameters to your liking and randomly generate a different solar system in each game for infinite replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face numerous difficulty levels that will test your strategist skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/e8763e488598e9e65492e61f10fa498b.webp?t=1751018853\" width=600 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171790/extras/ffe3bb284defdeb2e616d986d4b2fae4.avif?t=1751018853\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p>",
